ies":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"DnuRO4i1yI5REm5v1pUxWQ","review_id":"lxdy9pULtBAj9-OwN7zccw","date":"2019-04-18T02:36:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9446326494216919,"text_excerpt":"* GOOD FOOD a lil busy but GOOD * y'allllll this place has SUCH GOOD FOOD. I went for the first time with a friend from out of town who happened to be craving po-boys and melba's did not disappoint! we must've gone at a busy time though because the line & the wait was kinda long but honestly it was so worth it. the bread was nice & crispy, my smoked sausage was well seasoned, and the sauce & dressing on that po-boy was quite literally to die for also melba's is open 24/7 and has daiquiri deals like, every day I think??? you have no reason not to go"},{"business_id":"DnuRO4i1yI5REm5v1pUxWQ","review_id":"L1ByXvQJrooYqbOds97PMQ","date":"2019-10-14T17:56:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9348694086074829,"text_excerpt":"I love Melba's so much! Nothing makes me happier than a good plate lunch, and Melba's has them...24/7! You literally can't go wrong here--plates, poboys, fried chicken, they're all amazing. I might have a small addiction to the corn grits. And when I say small, I mean large. They're rich and buttery and go well with just about everything. The bourbon chicken is good, as are the ribs and stuffed peppers. I love to order on the kiosk so I can take my time, plus you get a free drink in a reusable parade cup! You can also do laundry and get a daiquiri while here, but I haven't tried either yet. I always say I'm going to get a daiquiri then I'm too full, but I've heard great things! Don't pass..."},{"business_id":"DnuRO4i1yI5REm5v1pUxWQ","review_id":"pj76jjuH8ClvlGk1P9BZJA","date":"2019-03-03T14:50:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9347788095474243,"text_excerpt":"In New Orleans getting the local experience. Really enjoyed Melba's cafeteria style dining. I had the wings, red beans and rice, and cabbage. The flavors were great! I only wished that the wings were sauced and that the cabbage wasn't so cooked down. I also enjoyed an amazing daiquiri. DELICIOUS !!! We waited about 30 minutes for our food but in the end it was worth it. Looking forward to trying some of their other dishes."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"DnuRO4i1yI5REm5v1pUxWQ","photo_id":"SxPSdt_F8fu6zuKWVnWHiA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SxPSdt_F8fu6zuKWVnWHiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8835859298706055},{"business_id":"DnuRO4i1yI5REm5v1pUxWQ","photo_id":"VkIKkbabdROR7hw380rnOg","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/VkIKkbabdROR7hw380rnOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8227882981300354},{"business_id":"DnuRO4i1yI5REm5v1pUxWQ","photo_id":"GgNUK2MuLUHzmF2jTkVUzA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GgNUK2MuLUHzmF2jTkVUzA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8222658634185791},{"business_id":"DnuRO4i1yI5REm5v1pUxWQ","photo_id":"W9-tJzrWLuAf6GQQFtGGVw","label":"f